## Interface: 30300
## Title: Esteria Manastorm
## Notes: The Manastorm: choose a depth, set your gadgets, follow your run. Open it with /manastorm, its key binding (Key Bindings > Esteria Manastorm) or the micro menu. Needs the wowdecomp client and an Esteria server with Manastorm.ClientMode = 2.
